Jābāli addresses Rāma with unlawful words --- Jābāli dismisses kinship and parental bonds --- Jābāli likens family to a traveler's lodging --- Jābāli bids Rāma crown himself in Ayōdhyā --- Jābāli denies Daśaratha's claim upon Rāma --- Jābāli mocks śrāddha and charity scriptures --- Jābāli preaches no beyond and urges the throne